{"id":"n75107-1-7","stage":4,"title":"전학 · 转学","scene":"校园与学习","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n75107-1-7-1","ko":"왜 민준이를 전학 보내려고 하세요?","zh":"为什么想要让敏俊转学呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"민준이를","meaning":"敏俊","explanation":"민준：敏俊；이：名词后缀，构成派生名词。；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"민준이를","audio":"/audio/5f6ad412fa56cdf3c242.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"민준이를","audio":"/audio/5f6ad412fa56cdf3c242.mp3"}},{"text":"전학","meaning":"转学","explanation":"전학：转学","readings":[{"term":"전학","audio":"/audio/5b1b2d4c492125f915eb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75107","senseId":"1","lemma":"전학","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"전학","audio":"/audio/5b1b2d4c492125f915eb.mp3"}},{"text":"보내려고","meaning":"送进，送去","explanation":"보내다：送进，送去；려고：表示意图或打算：“想要、打算”。","readings":[{"term":"보내다","audio":"/audio/8af300ffd85ed5a13777.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66375","senseId":"4","lemma":"보내다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보내려고","audio":"/audio/079364d3c2ac78e03fc5.mp3"}},{"text":"하세요?","meaning":"打算做（-려고 하다）","explanation":"하다：打算做（-려고 하다）；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"2","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하세요","audio":"/audio/20c70a963b62c0806108.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"5b1b2d4c492125f9","term":"전학","zh":"转学","audio":"/audio/5b1b2d4c492125f915eb.mp3","entryId":"75107","definition":"